.TH "SRANIME-CLI" "1" "September 2026" "sranime-cli 9.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
sranime-cli \- watch anime from the commandline
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B sranime-cli
[\fI\,OPTIONS\/\fR] [\fI\,QUERY\/\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
A shell script to browse and search anime from the command-line.
.PD 0
.P
.PD
This tool scrapes the site hianime.
.PD 0
.P
.PD
\f[B]sranime-cli\f[R] without options defaults to iina on macOS, flatpak mpv on Steamdeck, mpv apk on android, vlc on iOS and mpv media player everywhere else.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\--arc [name]\fR
Select or fuzzy-match a canonical story arc (e.g. "Marineford", "Chunin Exams", "Soul Society") and queue episodes.
.TP
\fB\--arcs\fR
Interactively browse and marathon story arcs in fzf/menu.
.TP
\fB\--party, --stream-lan [port]\fR
Start local Wi-Fi watch party server with terminal QR code (default port: 8888).
.TP
\fB\--party-stop\fR
Stop running background Watch Party streaming relay.
.TP
\fB\--party-status\fR
Display status, LAN IP, and URL of active Watch Party stream.
.TP

\fB\--skip-filler\fR
Automatically skip filler episodes during continuous autoplay binging (-A).
.TP
\fB\--canon-only\fR
Filter out all non-canon filler episodes from the episode selection picker.
.TP
\fB\--show-filler\fR
Display canon/filler status badges ([Canon], [Anime Canon], [Filler], [Mixed]) in episode list.
.TP
\fB\--dashboard | --tui\fR
Launch the full-screen interactive Anime Bento terminal dashboard.
.TP
\fB\--manga\fR [\fI\,query\/\fR]
Launch Manga Hub to search, browse chapters, and read manga in terminal or desktop viewer.
.TP
\fB\-c | --chapter\fR \fI\,<num>\/\fR
Jump directly to specified manga chapter number.
.TP
\fB\-md | --manga-download\fR
Download manga chapter pages locally as CBZ or image directory.
.TP
\fB\--manga-lang\fR \fI\,<lang>\/\fR
Preferred manga translation language (default: en).
.TP
\fB\-t | --theme\fR \fI\,<query>\/\fR
Search and stream creditless Opening (OP) & Ending (ED) theme songs directly via AnimeThemes.moe.
.TP
\fB\--theme-type\fR \fI\,<op|ed|all>\/\fR
Filter theme songs by OP or ED (default: all).
.TP
\fB\-ao | --audio-only\fR
Stream theme audio only without opening a video player window.
.TP
\fB\--theme-download\fR
Download selected theme song video/audio instead of streaming.
.TP
\fB\--notify-airing\fR [\fI\,hours\/\fR]
Check user watch history and AniList watchlists against live broadcast schedules and emit desktop notifications.
.TP
\fB\-O | --offline\fR [\fI\,path\/\fR]
Browse and play downloaded anime from the local vault with automatic subtitle attachment and checkpoint tracking.
.TP
\fB\--color-theme\fR \fI\,<name>\/\fR
Set terminal UI color palette: catppuccin, dracula, nord, gruvbox, tokyo-night, cyberpunk, or default.
.TP
\fB\--color-themes\fR
Display visual preview gallery of all terminal color theme palettes.
.TP
\fB\-e | --episode | -r | --range\fR \fI\,<episode>\/\fR
Specify the episode numbers to watch.
.TP
\fB\-c | --continue\fR
Continue watching anime from history.
.TP
\fB\-d | --download\fR
Download episode.
.TP
\fB\--show-history\fR
Display watch history and exit.
.TP
\fB\-D | --delete | --clear-history\fR
Delete history.
.TP
\fB\-l | --logview\fR
Show logs.
.TP
\fB\-h | --help\fR
Show summary of options.
.TP
\fB\-p | --provider\fR \fI\,<hianime|allanime|gogo>\/\fR
Specify stream provider. Default is hianime with automatic fallback to allanime and gogo.
.TP
\fB\-q | --quality\fR \fI\,<best|worst|360|480|720|1080>\/\fR
Set the video quality. Default quality is best.
.TP
\fB\-s | --syncplay\fR
Watch anime together with friends, using Syncplay (works with mpv only).
.TP
\fB\-U | --update\fR \fI\,<branch>\/\fR
Fetch update from github.
.TP
\fB\-v | --vlc\fR
Use VLC as the media player.
.TP
\fB\-S | --select-nth\fR \fI\,<index>\/\fR
Selects nth entry.
.TP
\fB\-N | --nextep-countdown\fR
Prints a countdown to the next episode.
.TP
\fB\--dub\fR
Play the dubbed version.
.TP
\fB\--rofi\fR
Use rofi instead of fzf for the interactive menu.
.TP
\fB\--dmenu\fR
Use dmenu instead of fzf for the interactive menu.
.TP
\fB\--skip\fR
Use ani-skip to skip the intro of the episode (mpv only).
.TP
\fB\--no-detach\fR
Don't detach the player (useful for in-terminal playback, mpv only).
.TP
\fB\--exit-after-play\fR
Exit the player, and return the player exit code.
.TP
\fB\--edit-config\fR
Open configuration file in default text editor.
.TP
\fB\--dump-config\fR
Print active configuration values and exit.
.TP
\fB\--login\fR [\fIanilist\fR|\fImal\fR]
Authenticate with AniList or MyAnimeList cloud trackers.
.TP
\fB\--scrobble-status\fR
Display status and active user of linked cloud tracking accounts.
.TP
\fB\--logout\fR [\fIanilist\fR|\fImal\fR]
Log out and clear stored credentials for tracking services.
.TP
\fB\--export-mal\fR [\fI\,<path>\/\fR]
Export lifetime watch log history in standard MyAnimeList XML format.
.TP
\fB\--import-mal\fR \fI\,<path>\/\fR
Import anime watch history from an exported MyAnimeList XML file into the local lifetime watch log.
.TP
\fB\--nfo\fR
Generate Jellyfin, Plex & Kodi .nfo metadata files and download cover/backdrop artwork alongside downloaded episodes.
.TP
\fB\--save-subs\fR
Extract and save external subtitle sidecars (.vtt/.srt) alongside downloaded video files.
.TP
\fB\--queue\fR
Enqueue episode(s) into the background download queue instead of downloading immediately.
.TP
\fB\--queue-status\fR
Display a formatted dashboard table showing the status of all queued and completed downloads.
.TP
\fB\--queue-start\fR
Launch or trigger the background download queue worker daemon.
.TP
\fB\--queue-pause\fR
Pause execution of background download queue workers.
.TP
\fB\--queue-resume\fR
Resume execution of background download queue workers.
.TP
\fB\--queue-clear\fR [\fIcompleted\fR|\fIall\fR]
Remove completed or all entries from the background download queue.
.TP
\fB\--sync\fR
Open interactive selection menu populated with shows from your AniList Currently Watching list.
.TP
\fB\--sync-list\fR
Display your AniList Currently Watching watchlist with episode progress and exit.
.TP
\fB\--no-scrobble\fR
Disable automatic AniList episode tracking for the current playback session.
.TP
\fB\--download-dir\fR \fI\,<path>\/\fR
Specify directory for downloaded anime files (default: ~/Videos/Anime).
.TP
\fB\--room\fR \fI\,<name>\/\fR
Set Syncplay room name and launch watch party (default: WatchParty).
.TP
\fB\--discord\fR
Enable Discord Rich Presence (enabled by default).
.TP
\fB\--no-discord\fR
Disable Discord Rich Presence for the current session.
.TP
\fB\-A | --autoplay\fR
Automatically play subsequent episodes continuously (binge mode).
.TP
\fB\--autoplay-limit\fR \fI\,<count>\/\fR
Limit the number of consecutive episodes played in autoplay mode.
.TP
\fB\-R | --resume\fR
Resume playback from the last saved timestamp checkpoint.
.TP
\fB\--start-time\fR \fI\,<time>\/\fR
Seek to an exact timestamp (MM:SS, HH:MM:SS, or integer seconds) on playback start.
.TP
\fB\--show-checkpoints\fR
Display active in-progress anime watch checkpoints with exact timestamps and percentage.
.TP
\fB\--clear-checkpoints\fR
Clear all stored playback timestamp checkpoints.
.TP
\fB\--seasonal\fR [\fI\,<season>\/\fR] [\fI\,<year>\/\fR]
Browse and stream popular anime from the current or specified broadcast season (WINTER, SPRING, SUMMER, FALL).
.TP
\fB\--trending\fR
Browse and stream currently trending anime releases.
.TP
\fB\--calendar\fR | \fB\--schedule\fR [\fI\,<hours>\/\fR]
Display upcoming airing schedule with localized countdown timers.
.TP
\fB\--similar\fR \fI\,<title>\/\fR
Discover and stream top anime recommendations based on a series.
.TP
\fB\--doctor\fR
Run system diagnostics and verify dependencies.
.TP
\fB\--watchlist\fR
Display the saved anime watchlist.
.TP
\fB\--watchlist-clear\fR
Clear all entries from the watchlist.
.TP
\fB\-W\fR, \fB\--watch-log\fR [\fIfilter\fR]
Display the lifetime watch log history, optionally filtered by title.
.TP
\fB\--watch-stats\fR
Display comprehensive viewing analytics, total time watched, and top series.
.TP
\fB\--watch-export\fR [\fBjson\fR|\fBcsv\fR]
Export the lifetime watch log into structured JSON or CSV format.
.TP
\fB\--clear-watch-log\fR
Clear the lifetime watch log.
.TP
\fB\--no-preview\fR
Disable the rich terminal preview pane in fzf.
.TP
\fB\--list-providers\fR
List available stream providers and exit.
.PP
.SH ENVIRONMENT VARIABLES
.PP
sranime-cli v5 uses environment variables to control features. Command-line options take precedence over env vars.
.TP
\fBSRANIME_CLI_BRANCH\fR
Controls the branch updated to with the -U option. Default is main.
.TP
\fBSRANIME_CLI_MODE\fR
Controls the media mode: sub or dub. Default is sub.
.TP
\fBSRANIME_CLI_DOWNLOAD_DIR\fR
Controls the download directory. Default is current dir.
.TP
\fBSRANIME_CLI_QUALITY\fR
Controls video quality. Default is best.
.TP
\fBSRANIME_CLI_PLAYER\fR
Sets the player. Can be debug, download, android_mpv, android_vlc, catt, or any URL-capable player.
.TP
\fBSRANIME_CLI_PLAYER_FLAGS\fR
Sets extra flags for the player.
.TP
\fBSRANIME_CLI_MENU\fR
Controls the frontend. Can be fzf, rofi, dmenu. Default is fzf.
.TP
\fBSRANIME_CLI_MENU_FLAGS\fR
Controls extra flags for the frontend.
.TP
\fBSRANIME_CLI_LOG\fR
Controls logging. 1 (enabled) or 0. Default is 1.
.TP
\fBSRANIME_CLI_HIST_DIR\fR
Controls history directory. Default is $XDG_STATE_HOME or ~/.local/state.
.TP
\fBSRANIME_CLI_DEFAULT_SOURCE\fR
Controls the default source. history or search. Default is search.
.TP
\fBSRANIME_CLI_SKIP_INTRO\fR
Controls ani-skip usage. 0 or 1. Default is 0.
.TP
\fBSRANIME_CLI_NO_DETACH\fR
Controls player detachment. 0 or 1. Default is 0.
.TP
\fBSRANIME_CLI_EXIT_AFTER_PLAY\fR
Controls menu return after playback. 0 or 1. Default is 0.
.TP
\fBSRANIME_CLI_MAX_RETRIES\fR
Maximum retry attempts for failed network requests. Default is 3.
.TP
\fBSRANIME_CLI_RETRY_DELAY\fR
Seconds between network retries. Default is 2.
.SH FILES
.TP
.I ~/.config/sranime-cli/sranime-cli.conf
Per-user configuration file.
.TP
.I /etc/sranime-cli/sranime-cli.conf
System-wide configuration file.
.TP
.I ~/.local/state/sranime-cli/sranime-hsts
History file storing watched anime and episode progress.
.TP
.I ~/.local/state/sranime-cli/watchlist
Persistent watchlist file for saved anime.
.TP
.I ~/.local/state/sranime-cli/watch.log
Lifetime append-only journal of all watched and downloaded anime episodes.
